Changes in version 0.99.0 (2026-08-23)
+ Package released with the Phase 1 matrix model
  (population-level isoform deconvolution X ~ AB with fixed A)
+ Phase 2 tensor model (model="tensor"): individual-specific
  cell-type-resolved isoform abundance via plain partial non-negative
  Tucker decomposition, fitted by block multiplicative updates with
  fixed A; warnings for generically non-identifiable rank regimes
+ Tensor-mode optimizer argument (optimizer = "lbfgs" / "hybrid" /
  "mu"): log-reparameterized L-BFGS with analytical gradients as the
  new default (port of the implementation validated in the
  isoTensor-experiments benchmarks; faster and substantially more
  accurate latent-tensor recovery than MU), MU kept as the monotone
  baseline, hybrid = MU then L-BFGS refinement; L-BFGS controls via
  optimizer.control = list(maxit, factr)
+ Fixed the thr=0 edge case: the initial RelChange sentinel is now
  kept strictly positive, so thr=0 runs all num.iter iterations
  instead of none
